[ti:Khaksar Diya]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sufi & Qawwali]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Log kahte hain tere hone se meri tadbeer barbaad hai
[00:10.75]Log kahte hain... log kahte hain...
[00:13.51]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon — uski khayal mein hona bhi taqdeer ki baat hai
[00:19.02]Wo kahte hain diya hawa ke saamne kyun jalaye
[00:21.77]Ye to bujh jayega... ye to mit jayega... ye to khaak mein mil jayega
[00:27.28]Kya kahoon
[00:32.79]Jalna hi jalna hai
[00:35.54]Bujhna to andhera hai
[00:38.30]Jalna hi paana hai
[00:43.81]Magar ye jalna bhi kisi ki den hai
[00:46.56]Aur den ko jalna kehna — ye bhi parwaane ki hai justaju
[00:49.32]Log kahte hain tere hone se meri tadbeer barbaad hai
[00:52.07]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon — uski khayal mein hona bhi taqdeer ki baat hai
[00:57.58]Poochhte hain zakhm kyun nahi bhartaa
[01:00.33]Kyun hardam rota rehta hai
[01:05.84]Kya kahoon
[01:11.35]Hai bhoolna
[01:14.11]Hai maut
[01:16.86]Hai jeena
[01:22.37]Zakhm bharna hi bhoolna hai
[01:25.12]Bhoolna hi maut hai
[01:27.88]Zakhm jeena hai
[01:33.39]Har zakhm teri yaad ka kinaara hai
[01:36.14]Zakhm bhi kisko milte hain
[01:38.90]Ye bhi kisi ki aankhon ka upahaar hai
[01:44.40]Aur upahaar ko zakhm kehna — ye bhi parwaane ki hai justaju
[01:47.16]Log kahte hain tere hone se meri tadbeer barbaad hai
[01:49.91]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon — uski khayal mein hona bhi taqdeer ki baat hai
[01:55.42]Wo kahte hain tune apna ghar kyun ujada
[01:58.18]Apna naam kyun mitaya
[02:03.69]Kya kahoon
[02:09.19]Hai ujadna
[02:11.95]Hai mitna
[02:14.70]Hai rehna
[02:20.21]Ujadna bhi agar uski raza se ho
[02:22.97]To wo ghar nahi
[02:25.72]Haram hai
[02:31.23]Barbaadi ko barbaadi mat samjho
[02:33.98]Ye to us rang ki shuruaat hai
[02:36.74]Jahan pahunchne ke baad
[02:39.49]Koi lautna nahi chahta
[02:45.00]Aur is rang ko barbaadi kehna — ye bhi parwaane ki hai justaju
[02:47.76]Log kahte hain... tere hone se...
[02:50.51]Meri tadbeer barbaad hai...
[02:53.26]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon...
[02:56.02]Uski khayal mein hona bhi...
[03:01.53]Taqdeer ki baat hai
[03:09.79]Jogi ban ke aaya tha
[03:15.30]Preetam ne rang diya
[03:20.81]Barbaadi mein goonge jaisa har koi
[03:26.32]Par ye goongapan bhi to usi ki den hai
[03:34.58]Hai chuppi
[03:37.34]Hai bolna
[03:40.09]Hai milan
[03:45.60]Bolna kya cheez hai
[03:51.11]Uska naam lena bhi milan hai
[03:56.62]Aur milan se pehle khayal aana
[04:02.13]Wo to bas ek jhalak hai
[04:10.39]Hai jhalak
[04:13.14]Hai taqdeer
[04:15.90]Hai justaju
[04:21.41]Par ye jhalak bhi kise milti hai
[04:26.91]Wo bhi kisi ki taqdeer ki baat hai
[04:35.18]Aur is jhalak ko milan kehna — ye bhi parwaane ki hai justaju
[04:40.69]Log kahte hain...
[04:46.20]Tere hone se...
[04:51.70]Meri tadbeer barbaad hai...
[04:57.21]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon...
[05:02.72]Uski khayal mein hona bhi...
[05:08.23]Taqdeer ki baat hai
[05:16.49]Hey Maula...
[05:22.00]Jo parwana ho
[05:27.51]Use ye samjha
[05:35.78]Hai jalna
[05:38.53]Hai den
[05:41.28]Hai justaju
[05:46.79]Ki jalna hi uski justaju thi
[05:52.30]Aur justaju hi uski ibaadat hai
[06:00.56]Ameen...
[06:08.83]Ameen...
[06:17.09]Ameen...
